      "rationale": "Resolves a platform-specific runtime failure on macOS and BSD systems where select() rejects timeouts above 10^8 seconds. Although it addresses supported-platform compatibility, it affects only the -rpcclienttimeout=0 invocation rather than general node build or run capability."
